# wear/man/gown_sleeve_r: the gown's fitted sleeve: the gilt cuff (the arm library's cuff region, doll_resolve) drawn to a point
# at the wrist; keys the overlay lacks fall back to the plain gilt cuff (right arm), drawn over the arm library's keys
# GARB-M (P2b wave 2). Drafted from arms/adult/loco/man_r.pxm by recolouring its sleeve rows, then hand-checked composed.
use person woman
legend Z linen 4
legend W metal2 0
body man
role garment gown
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1
tags overlay

